{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% set R = d.runs %}
{% block title %}Research · Pramana Research{% endblock %}
{% block description %}Studies by Pramana Research on whether AI models can show their work: pre-registered, with every answer and all code published.{% endblock %}
{% block main %}
<div class="wrap">
<div class="titleblock">
  <p class="eyebrow">Research</p>
  <h1>Evidence before claims</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">We study whether AI models can show their work. Our studies are independent community research: pre-registered, not peer-reviewed, and published with the protocol, the data, every model answer and the code, so anyone can check the results.</p>
</div>
<a class="card" href="/research/filing-evidence" style="padding:28px;max-width:900px">
  <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:12px">Community research report · Not peer-reviewed · {{ DATE }} · Krishna Nandula</p>
  <div class="n" style="font-size:24px;line-height:1.25">Show Your Work: Can Small Open Models Read SEC Filings with Evidence a Machine Can Check?</div>
  <p style="color:#3D4452;margin:14px 0 0;font-size:16px">Ten open models on one consumer GPU, 1,000 questions over 90 SEC filings. The best answers {{ R[H.best_any[0]].setups[H.best_any[1]].summary.accuracy.rate | pct }} correctly with a quote a machine can check; even so, wrong answers that pass every check remain, and we show exactly what they are.</p>
  <div class="r" style="margin-top:18px"><span>Read the paper →</span><span>PDF · code · data</span></div>
</a>
<p class="muted" style="max-width:900px;font-size:14px;margin-top:28px"><b>Disclaimer.</b> This is an independent community research report, written in a personal capacity; it does not represent the views of any employer or other organisation. It is not affiliated with, sponsored or endorsed by any company or model developer named here; all names and trademarks belong to their owners. Results describe specific model versions under one fixed setup and are not a general judgement of any model. The data, results and code are provided as is, without warranty, and may contain errors; check any figure against the original filing. Nothing here is financial, investment or legal advice.</p>
</div>
{% endblock %}
